  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LUANAR Infrastructure Development Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The infrastructure projectl focuses on the following four areas: i) construction of 208 bed hostel for  female students, ii) construction of one teaching complex, iii) rehabilitation of old classrooms and lecture rooms, iv) and improvement of water supply and sanitation facilities.</narrative>
  </description>
